OL,3,GNEWSAProtest about introduction of red
OL,4,Aroute
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of people took to a street to
OL,7,Fprotest against plans to prevent
OL,8,Fdrivers from stopping there, as workers
OL,9,Fprepared to start painting road
OL,10,Fmarkings.
OL,12,FThe red route, along parts of busy
OL,13,Fshopping street Western Road in Hove,
OL,14,Fwill prohibit drivers from stopping
OL,15,Fbetween Montpelier Road and Holland
OL,16,FRoad after a vote by Brighton & Hove
OL,17,FCity Council's cabinet in September.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
