OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAProtest about introduction of red
OL,4,Aroute
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusiness owners and residents have
OL,7,Fcampaigned against the route, which is
OL,8,Fdue to begin this month, and submitted
OL,9,Fa petition signed by more than 3,000
OL,10,Fpeople.
OL,12,FJacob Taylor, Labour deputy leader of
OL,13,Fthe council, said he hoped the route
OL,14,Fwould not make any money from fines
OL,15,Fbecause "then it would be working".
